    "text": "By Ken Trainor ,\n1 days ago This Saturday is the next “No Kings” rally against the reign of an authoritarian with delusions of monarchical grandeur. This country began by rebelling against just such an unjust monarchy, and 250 years later another wannabe royalist wants to re-establish it. And we get to exercise our First Amendment rights of free speech and assembly to say what we think of Himself and his aspirations. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
